        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP221R, Flush Pocket Door Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis flush pull installs on flush on pocket doors and by pass closet doors to allow you to slide the door open or closed. Normally used on standard pre-drilled doors (common bore hole size for a regular door knob or lever). The Solid Brass Round Flush Pull measures 2-1/8\" inside cup diameter. Available in nine finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP221R-Specifications.gif?v=1704354729\" width=\"376\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP221R Round Flush Door Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP221R Round Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1/32\" Thick Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP221R.pdf?v=1704262160\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP221R  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
