                "description": "Solid Brass Round Pocket Door Pull Deltana FP221R - TThis flush pull installs on flush on pocket doors and by pass closet doors to allow you to slide the door open or closed. Normally used on standard pre-drilled doors (common bore hole size for a regular door knob or lever). The Solid Brass Round Flush Pull measures 2-1/8 inches inside cup diameter. Available in nine finishes.",
